  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a bowl, mix together ricotta cheese, parmesan cheese, eggs, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add chopped parsley to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Open the can of chestnut mushrooms and drain the liquid.",
    "In a skillet, melt butter over medium heat.",
    "Add the flour and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the mushrooms to the skillet and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the mushroom mixture to the bowl with the ricotta cheese mixture and mix well.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Place the papillote on top of the mixture.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 25-30 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and let it cool for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
